{"AI_used_extensively":true,"actual_tracker_values":[["OWR-12697710-015 (30005468) — Rational certificates for truncated moment nonrepresentability","","https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23196750","Research note: p=1+f on the rational three-variable unit ball has minimum 1, annihilates an explicit rational mass-1 degree-4 moment vector, and lies in 1+Q_R(g) but not 1+Q_Q(g), for rational polynomial-square multipliers of arbitrary finite degree. The input moment matrix is not PSD. A different q=1+x^4 works rationally; p itself and each rational rescaling cp, c>1 are rationally positivity-certifiable. Classical quartic/local obstruction and earlier real-ball/Gram/SDP applications credited. Three bounded priority families and two fresh whole-package adversarial reviews; disclosed source limits, no worldwide-firstness/current-openness guarantee. Extensive AI assistance; unrefereed, without independent human peer review or formal proof-assistant certification. https://zenodo.org/records/23196750; original PR https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/278"]],"additional_author_proof_search_turns":0,"binary_Git_copies":false,"bounded_priority_not_worldwide_absence":true,"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.23196750","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23196750","final_selector":{"bytes":5895,"path":"/Users/alec/Documents/Math/draft_pr_descending_audit_20261002/audits/pr278_30005468/ROOT_FINAL_PUBLICATION_PACKET_PINS_01.json","sha256":"600c04cd201e9fc04ee8b07ba84e13de3b97ffed6f263504aa973711015b5bd7"},"formal_proof_assistant_certification":false,"independent_human_peer_review":false,"inherited_original_leaves":[{"bytes":504,"git_blob":"f826e4a18e3a0646f57701d1bbcab1ce48f9dec9","path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30005468/CHECKS.json","sha256":"434a1cd7a7174de9dad34eee2b607d171e4cab0f3d631ec04bdb0fb27f4a5752"},{"bytes":1667,"git_blob":"c6035fbe70cdf9baeb99c899a129f8099bff4673","path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30005468/FROZEN_MANIFEST.json","sha256":"4fd0839ba91bc760